  "notes": "SOCIAL MEDIA TERM:\nリツイート originated from Twitter (now X) and refers to sharing someone else's tweet with your followers.\n\nFORMS:\n- RT (アールティー) - common abbreviation for retweet\n\nTYPES:\n- リツイート - simple retweet (sharing as-is)\n- {引用|いんよう}リツイート - quote retweet (adding your own comment)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- リポスト - repost (more general term, also used on X)\n- シェア - share\n- いいね - like\n- フォロワー - follower\n\nUSAGE:\nX (formerly Twitter) officially renamed \"Retweet\" to \"Repost\" in 2023, but both terms are still used in Japanese.",
